bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Reply comment 1

actor User
boundary "Chapter Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
control ChapterService
control MangaService
entity ":ReplyModel" as ReplyModel
database MongoDB

ReplyService -> ReplyModel: 1. save reply
activate ReplyModel
activate ReplyService
ReplyModel -> MongoDB: 2. insert reply
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReplyModel: 3. savedReply
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyModel --> ReplyService: 4. savedReply
deactivate ReplyModel

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 5. Check save result
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

opt Create Reply Failed
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.1. Error
    activate ReplyController
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.2. 500 Error
    activate Router
    Router --> UI: 5.3 Show error
    activate UI
    UI --> User: 5.4 Error message
    activate User
end

ReplyService -> ChapterService: 6. getChapterById(chapter_id)
activate ChapterService
ChapterService --> ReplyService: 7. chapter
deactivate ChapterService

ReplyService -> MangaService: 8. get author
activate MangaService
MangaService --> ReplyService: 9. manga
deactivate MangaService

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 10. Check manga
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

opt Invalid manga id
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 10.1. Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 10.2. 400 Error
    deactivate ReplyController
    Router --> UI: 10.3 Show error
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: 10.4 Error message
    deactivate User
    deactivate UI
end
@enduml